// ============================================================================
// BEST PRACTICES DEMONSTRATED
// ============================================================================

// ✅ Type safety: Auto-generated Prisma types
// ✅ Relationships: Foreign keys with cascade delete
// ✅ Indexes: Strategic indexes for performance
// ✅ Timestamps: Automatic createdAt, updatedAt
// ✅ Validation: Email uniqueness enforced at database level
// ✅ Migrations: Version-controlled schema changes
// ✅ Client singleton: Prevent multiple PrismaClient instances
// ✅ Logging: Development logging for debugging
// ✅ Queries: Efficient queries with select and include
// ✅ Pagination: Built-in skip/take for large datasets
